## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
# NOTE: a legacy "**/[Pp]ackages/" rule used to live here — the packages.config-era
# convention for NuGet's local restore folder. This repo uses SDK-style projects with
# PackageReference exclusively (restored to the global ~/.nuget/packages cache, never a
# project-local folder), so that rule was pure dead weight — and dangerous dead weight:
# it silently swallowed real source directories named "Packages"/"packages" from git on
# at least three separate occasions (a backend Application/Packages/ folder whose commands
# were never committed, and a frontend features/packages/ folder that had to be renamed to
# features/session-packages/ to work around it). Removed 2026-09-10 rather than scoped
# more narrowly, since nothing in this repo needs it at all.
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
nuget.config

## ASP.NET Core
# appsettings.Development.json is intentionally ignored — it carries local secrets
